ble.\n- Keep proprietary inputs and resulting game assets outside version control while storing redistributable evidence and attestations.\n- Block complete Encode Conformance and the public release on any missing, stale, ambiguous, or failed qualification result.\n\n## Ownership\n\nHuman-driven when unblocked. Preparation may be automated, but the named evidence or approval must come from the maintainer or operator.\n\n## Non-goals\n\n- Do not expand this issue beyond its independently mergeable outcome or bypass a native blocker relationship.\n- Never modify the pinned TES5Edit Reference Snapshot or commit proprietary/local game assets.\n- Do not add GUI behavior, non-Windows guarantees, Maven Central/GitHub Packages publication, or moving-reference compatibility.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/58/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/58/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/55","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/55/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/55/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/55/events","html_url":"https://github.com/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/55","id":5333339454,"node_id":"I_kwDOULuKyc8AAAABPeRNPg","number":55,"title":"Run first-release performance-v1 qualification and establish the baseline","user":{"login":"evildarkarchon","id":11204783,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjA0Nzgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11204783?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evildarkarchon","html_url":"https://github.com/evildarkarchon","followers_u